{"seq":6,"slug":"technique-patterns","title":"技巧模式","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/technique-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-pointers","title":"双指针","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/technique-patterns/two-pointers","wordCount":1103,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"sliding-window","title":"滑动窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/technique-patterns/sliding-window","wordCount":975,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"prefix-sum","title":"前缀和与差分数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/technique-patterns/prefix-sum","wordCount":905,"readingTime":4},{"seq":4,"slug":"bit-manipulation","title":"位运算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/technique-patterns/bit-manipulation","wordCount":989,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"技巧模式-简介\">技巧模式 简介</h1><p>算法解题中存在一类高频出现的通用技巧，它们不像排序或动态规划那样自成体系，却能在各类问题中反复发挥关键作用。掌握这些技巧模式，意味着你拥有了一套可以跨题型复用的&quot;工具箱&quot;，在面对陌生问题时能够迅速识别适用的解法框架并高效实现。</p>\n<p>本章聚焦于四种最核心的算法技巧模式，它们在面试和工程实践中都有极高的出现频率。</p>\n<p><strong>双指针</strong> 是利用两个指针在数组或链表上协同移动来解决问题的策略。根据指针的运动方式，又可细分为快慢指针、对撞指针和相向指针等变体。双指针技巧能够将许多朴素的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 解法优化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，是数组和链表类问题的核心武器。</p>\n<p><strong>滑动窗口</strong> 可以看作双指针的一种特殊应用，它维护一个在序列上滑动的区间，通过窗口的扩张与收缩来高效处理子数组或子串问题。无论是定长窗口还是变长窗口，滑动窗口都能帮助你以线性时间复杂度解决原本需要嵌套循环的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>前缀和与差分数组</strong> 是一对互逆的数据预处理技巧。前缀和通过一次预计算实现任意区间和的常数时间查询，差分数组则将区间批量修改的复杂度从线性降为常数。这两种技巧在一维和二维场景中都有广泛应用，是处理区间查询与区间更新问题的基石。</p>\n<p><strong>位运算</strong> 利用计算机底层的二进制操作来实现高效计算。与、或、异或、移位等基本运算看似简单，却能巧妙地解决去重、查找、状态压缩等一系列问题。理解位运算不仅能帮助你写出更优雅的代码，还能在特定场景下实现常数级别的性能提升。</p>\n<p>建议按照章节顺序依次学习。双指针和滑动窗口在概念上紧密相连，前缀和与差分数组互为补充，位运算则相对独立。每一节都配有详细的模式分析、模板代码和经典例题，动手实践是掌握这些技巧的最佳途径。</p>\n"}